{"content":[{"c":["BELIEVERS"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Those who believe; in the NT, specifically, those who believe in Jesus as Lord and follow him (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.5.14","r":"Acts.5.14","rawR":"Acts.5.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.5.14","value":"Acts.5.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 5:14"},"). One would expect the term “believers” (sometimes translated “faithful”) to be a title for Christians, since the NT stresses belief in Jesus. Although NT authors emphasized believing, they rarely used the term “believer” as a name for Christians. There are a few clear examples (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.4.32","r":"Acts.4.32","rawR":"Acts.4.32","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.4.32","value":"Acts.4.32"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 4:32"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.10.45","r":"Acts.10.45","rawR":"Acts.10.45","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.10.45","value":"Acts.10.45"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:45"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.19.18","r":"Acts.19.18","rawR":"Acts.19.18","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.19.18","value":"Acts.19.18"}],"t":"ref","v":"19:18"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Tim.4.12","r":"1Tim.4.12","rawR":"1Tim.4.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Tim.4.12","value":"1Tim.4.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Tm 4:12"},"), but in other places the term is a description, not a name (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.2.44","r":"Acts.2.44","rawR":"Acts.2.44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.2.44","value":"Acts.2.44"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 2:44"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.15.5","r":"Acts.15.5","rawR":"Acts.15.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.15.5","value":"Acts.15.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Acts.18.27","r":"Acts.18.27","rawR":"Acts.18.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.18.27","value":"Acts.18.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"18:27"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Tim.4.3","r":"1Tim.4.3","rawR":"1Tim.4.3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Tim.4.3","value":"1Tim.4.3"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Tm 4:3"},"). As a name, “believer” points to the personal commitment of Christians to Jesus. Christians were called not merely to believe something but to give themselves to someone."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Believers","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Acts 5:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.5.14","rawQueryValue":"Acts.5.14","sourceRefExact":"Acts.5.14"},{"anchorText":"Acts 4:32","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.4.32","rawQueryValue":"Acts.4.32","sourceRefExact":"Acts.4.32"},{"anchorText":"10:45","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.10.45","rawQueryValue":"Acts.10.45","sourceRefExact":"Acts.10.45"},{"anchorText":"19:18","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.19.18","rawQueryValue":"Acts.19.18","sourceRefExact":"Acts.19.18"},{"anchorText":"1 Tm 4:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Tim.4.12","rawQueryValue":"1Tim.4.12","sourceRefExact":"1Tim.4.12"},{"anchorText":"Acts 2:44","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.2.44","rawQueryValue":"Acts.2.44","sourceRefExact":"Acts.2.44"},{"anchorText":"15:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.15.5","rawQueryValue":"Acts.15.5","sourceRefExact":"Acts.15.5"},{"anchorText":"18:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.18.27","rawQueryValue":"Acts.18.27","sourceRefExact":"Acts.18.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Tm 4:3","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Tim.4.3","rawQueryValue":"1Tim.4.3","sourceRefExact":"1Tim.4.3"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ca137b304339b0f6ea06e59687c52dc96ebde39226ce894e882050e341108aa3","sourceItemName":"Believers","sourceItemOrder":164,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Believers","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Believers","title":"Believers","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}